n all sets): SELECT Col1, Col2, ..., ColN FROM (ResultOfSecondGroupBy) WHERE total_c = NumberOfInputSets. Projection: The final step projects out the original columns, effectively discarding the count columns and any other temporary columns added during the transformation process.'}], 'model': 'llama3:8b', 'max_tokens': 1024, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.1}}
